    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d809">

                <pb facs="0672" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/12425a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent Carothers.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 3, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Allow me to urge upon you again the importance of bringing the Constitutionalist
                    leaders into hearty cooperation. If the opinion of this Government has weight
                    with them show them how suicidal it <pb facs="0673" n="557" xml:id="pg557"/>
                    will be for them to fall out at this time. They must have confidence in each
                    other and work together until they secure the reforms necessary for the
                    restoration of permanent peace and prosperity.</p>
                <p>Vice Consul Silliman will reach Saltillo early next week. He can keep in touch
                    with Carranza while you use your friendship with Villa to restore harmony.</p>
                <p>Urge upon Carranza the imperative necessity of sending representatives at once to
                    confer with Huertista representatives. We feel sure they can secure an agreement
                    which will give the Constitutionalists control of the provisional government and
                    thus secure by peaceful means all that they could secure by arms.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
